---
// How it works — the two real activation modes (rekody-hotkey):
// hold = push-to-talk; quick-tap (≤300ms) latches hands-free, tap again stops.
---

<section id="how-it-works" style="background:#FFFFFF;">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-24 flex flex-col gap-11">

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 items-start">
      <p class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase" style="color:var(--color-teal); letter-spacing:0.16em;">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,54px); line-height:1.08;">
        Hold for a quick note. Tap to go hands-free.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-7">
      <article class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-9" style="background:var(--color-cream-warm); border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);">
        <p><span class="key">hold ⌥ space</span></p>
        <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-weight:600; font-size:26px; color:var(--color-ink);">Hold to talk</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px]" style="color:var(--color-ink-mute); line-height:1.65;">
          Hold the shortcut and speak. The pill shows which app you're typing into,
          and the words appear as you say them. Release, and the final text lands at your cursor.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-9" style="background:var(--color-cream-warm); border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);">
        <p><span class="key" style="color:var(--color-teal); background:var(--color-teal-soft); border-color:rgba(32,128,141,0.25);">tap ⌥ space</span></p>
        <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-weight:600; font-size:26px; color:var(--color-ink);">Tap for hands-free</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px]" style="color:var(--color-ink-mute); line-height:1.65;">
          Quick-tap the shortcut instead, and keep talking as long as you like.
          Tap again to stop. Made for longer dictation, or when your hands are busy.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
